  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Your Bandage** (1 other source): Nicole Lawrence returns for this part of the set, and the song is accompanied by banter [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Armies of the Lord**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Cold at Night**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Dawn of Revelation**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Design Your Own Container Garden**: back after 48 archived shows (729 days); rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **The Last Limit of Bhakti**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Great Pirates**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **Your Bandage**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **The Lady From Shanghai 2**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2025-12-13** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 23 songs; 113 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Cameron Ralston, Matt Douglas, and Jon Wurster return, and some, Nicole Lawrence returns and Bandage, No Children, real [1]\n- Nicole Lawrence plays on many songs during this show; Cameron Ralston, Matt Douglas and Jon Wurster return, with banter between songs [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2025-12-13**: taped by Kyle Kennelly & Emerald Green; transferred by Kyle Kennelly; source: FR-AV2 > DPA 4060s (Healy on stage) + FR-AVR > Neumann KM184 (DFC FOB PAS) + SBD > PCM-A10 [1]. Also: The venue charged a steep recording fee, covered partly by contributions from fans; the uploader says the taping was worthwhile [1]",
